    {
      "name": "perspectives",
      "route": "/perspectives",
      "url": "https://2020insights.net/perspectives",
      "title": "Perspectives | Insights",
      "description": null,
      "height": 1673,
      "frame": "perspectives.png",
      "full": "perspectives-full.png",
      "videos": [],
      "phone": {
        "frame": "m-perspectives.png",
        "full": "m-perspectives-full.png",
        "height": 3722
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "Perspectives",
          "where": "header"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Exploring Strategy, Mission, Engagement, and Leadership",
          "where": "header"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Vision is Cheap. Execution is Magic.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "What separates visionaries from changemakers? Execution...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "The Right Goal System Isn't a Method. It's a Mindset.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "It's not about which system is better, but which fits your leadership style...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Alignment is a Verb.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Software doesn't change teams. Culture does. But the right tools amplify alignment...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Purpose Is the New Paycheck.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "People don't burn out from working hard, but from working without meaning...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Purpose isn't fluff. It's fuel.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "When your platform connects work to mission... engagement isn't managed, it's unleashed...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Organizations Don't Need Optimization. They Need Oxygen.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Optimize all you want—but if your teams don't talk, trust, or breathe, your org isn't healthy...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Insights",
          "where": "footer"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Purpose-powered performance...",
